# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Build context of docker/Dockerfile: only what building `rt` needs (the Cargo workspace and
# the license files). Everything else stays out, so the image never sees local data.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!crates/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/
!plugins/
# The kit's crates (submodule kit/): Cargo reads kit/Cargo.toml for the workspace fields.
!kit/Cargo.toml
!kit/crates/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
